    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tower Defence Game Where YOU Are the Invader</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Tokyo\u2019s Neon Monsters</i>, you play as an adorable giant kaiju micromanaging  resources as you struggle to defend your Neon Queen \u2014 a colossal cosmic entity who demolishes buildings, feeds on toxic waste, and births armies of needy baby monsters that defend your captured territory against hordes of angry humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/49c5ebbd58920d5cafab132dbf4d2232.poster.avif?t=1753427320\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/49c5ebbd58920d5cafab132dbf4d2232.webm?t=1753427320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/49c5ebbd58920d5cafab132dbf4d2232.mp4?t=1753427320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Completely destructible Neon City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Monster evolutions</strong> that enhance your defence strategically</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Wide variety of rogue-like upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Hordes of Human Resistance</strong> featuring different types and characteristics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Stylized Voxel Art</strong> &amp; Neon Glow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/cf1ce08b11f6e0dfd795a2ab42e9e5af.poster.avif?t=1753427320\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/cf1ce08b11f6e0dfd795a2ab42e9e5af.webm?t=1753427320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/cf1ce08b11f6e0dfd795a2ab42e9e5af.mp4?t=1753427320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now &amp; Join the Invasion!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to unleash the Neon Queen and her monstrous army. Wishlist now on Steam and join our Discord to be part of the development journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/9a80a9c20cc2e1dcaeee4c8842cf2c10.avif?t=1753427320\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tower Defence Game Where YOU Are the Invader</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Tokyo\u2019s Neon Monsters</i>, you play as an adorable giant kaiju micromanaging  resources as you struggle to defend your Neon Queen \u2014 a colossal cosmic entity who demolishes buildings, feeds on toxic waste, and births armies of needy baby monsters that defend your captured territory against hordes of angry humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/49c5ebbd58920d5cafab132dbf4d2232.poster.avif?t=1753427320\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/49c5ebbd58920d5cafab132dbf4d2232.webm?t=1753427320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/49c5ebbd58920d5cafab132dbf4d2232.mp4?t=1753427320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Completely destructible Neon City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Monster evolutions</strong> that enhance your defence strategically</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Wide variety of rogue-like upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Hordes of Human Resistance</strong> featuring different types and characteristics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Stylized Voxel Art</strong> &amp; Neon Glow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/cf1ce08b11f6e0dfd795a2ab42e9e5af.poster.avif?t=1753427320\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/cf1ce08b11f6e0dfd795a2ab42e9e5af.webm?t=1753427320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/cf1ce08b11f6e0dfd795a2ab42e9e5af.mp4?t=1753427320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now &amp; Join the Invasion!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to unleash the Neon Queen and her monstrous army. Wishlist now on Steam and join our Discord to be part of the development journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/9a80a9c20cc2e1dcaeee4c8842cf2c10.avif?t=1753427320\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an electrifying journey through the neon-lit streets of Tokyo in &quot;Tokyo\u2019s Neon Monsters&quot; \u2013 an adrenaline-pumping fusion of real-time strategy and tower defence like you've never experienced before!",
